# Quick reference

## Commands

```bash
bun install
bun run dev:gateway
bun run dev:desktop
bun run dev:android
bun run dev:cli
bun run validate
bun check
bun lint
bun run format:write
bun test
bun run test:contracts
bun run gateway:free
bun run docs:dev
```

## Paths

| Path | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `apps/desktop` | Electron |
| `apps/mobile` | Expo Android |
| `apps/web` | Expo PWA |
| `apps/cli` | `ctrl-f5` CLI |
| `packages/ctrl-*` | Gateway, protocol, runtimes, memory, agent, MCP, knowledge, channels, client, contracts |
| `docs/` | Plan, soak, CI, security docs |
| `native/android-litert/` | On-device LiteRT |

## Env (common)

- `CTRL_HOST`, `CTRL_PORT`, `CTRL_TOKEN`
- `CTRL_LLAMA_BIN`
- `CTRL_EMBEDDINGS` (`hash` \| `openai` \| `llama` \| `litert` \| `off`)
- `CTRL_EMBEDDINGS_MODEL`, `CTRL_EMBEDDINGS_DIM`, `CTRL_EMBEDDINGS_BASE_URL`, `CTRL_EMBEDDINGS_API_KEY`
- `BASE_URL` — contract tests

## Stack

TypeScript + Bun workspaces · React (Electron/Expo) · VitePress (docs/Vue) · `bun:sqlite` · `bun:test` · Matrix `#00ff66`
